          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Omwana gw'Entaama obu yabambwire emanyiikirizo eya kataano, narora hansi y'itambiro emyoyo y'abo abaisirwe habw'ekigambo kya Ruhanga, na habw'obwakaiso obu baahaire; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.6.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.6.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 6:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "baatoka n'iraka likooto bati: “Ai Kamarabyona, ahikiriire kandi ow'amazima, olimara kasumi ki otakacweriire musango abo abaikara omunsi, kandi olibahoora di enzigu habw'esagama yaitu?” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.6.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.6.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 6:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
