        },
        {
          "text": "Omu kubonekerwa kwange, Omwana gw'Entaama obu yabambwire emanyiikirizo eya mukaaga, haabaho omusisa ogw'amaani; izooba lyaraara, lyasisana orugoye orurukwiragura, okwezi kwona kwatukura nk'esagama, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.6.12",
